            <title>[IGNITE-16327] Distributed process may crash with NPE if the communication message has not been read completely. </title>
                <link>https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/IGNITE-16327</link>
                <project id="12315922" key="IGNITE">Ignite</project>
                    <description>&lt;p&gt;Under some circumstances, the following critical error may happen during SingleNodeMessage deserialization.&lt;/p&gt;

